#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
#| "Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Kekal terkini dengan versi terbaru\">\n"
"Semak secara berkala [nota pelepasan Qiskit Runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) untuk melihat keluaran baru. Kami syorkan agar kamu selalu mengemaskini keperluan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` dengan menjalankan `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

